  "title": "Romantic Chicken with Artichokes and Mushrooms",
  "description": "Chicken is browned and simmered with marinated artichoke hearts, mushrooms, white wine, and capers. A simple, savory aromatic treat.",
  "authors": [
    "Caity-O"
  ],
